OL,3,ARight-wing commentator Milo
OL,4,AYiannopoulos detained by ICE
OL,5,
OL,6,FBritish right-wing political
OL,7,Fcommentator Milo Yiannopoulos has
OL,8,Fapparently been detained by Immigration
OL,9,Fand Customs Enforcement (ICE),
OL,10,Faccording to the agency's records.
OL,12,FYiannopoulos, 41, a former editor of
OL,13,FBreitbart News and a onetime employee
OL,14,Fof rapper Kanye West, appears to be
OL,15,Fheld in Louisiana, according to a
OL,16,Fsearch of ICE's inmate registry.
OL,18,FThe self-styled provocateur has called
OL,19,Fhimself the "most fabulous supervillain
OL,20,Fon the internet". His critics call him
OL,21,Fa purveyor of hate speech.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
